// ../agent-policy.dw with the trade gate made a CONJUNCTION -- the one change, at the bottom.
//
// The article states its two trade protections as two `permit` rules on `execute_trade`, and two
// permits on one action are alternatives: either matching is enough. So a fresh price alone opened
// the trade with no profile check at all -- the prompt-injection case the integrity rule exists to
// prevent. Here the freshness permit grants the trade, and a `forbid` refuses it UNLESS this
// trajectory loaded the profile the trade names. A forbid overrides any permit, so both must hold.
//
// Checked against TradeGate.tla beside it, all five claims: both prerequisites are now required,
// and the intended path -- both present -- is still open.
//
// The same transcription notes as ../agent-policy.dw apply: resource scopes and `eventResource`
// joins are dropped, and the read actions are permitted so the chain can run.

// ---- the reads, which the article's snippets assume exist ---------------------------------
permit (
    principal,
    action == AgentCore::Action::"get_client_profile",
    resource
);

permit (
    principal,
    action == AgentCore::Action::"get_market_price",
    resource
);

permit (
    principal,
    action == AgentCore::Action::"interact_advisor",
    resource
);

// ---- policy 1: workflow sequencing, unchanged ---------------------------------------------
permit (
    principal,
    action == AgentCore::Action::"load_portfolio",
    resource
)
when temporal {
    formerly within 5m AgentCore::Action::"get_client_profile"::response{ }
};

permit (
    principal,
    action == AgentCore::Action::"rebalance_portfolio",
    resource
)
when temporal {
    formerly within 5m AgentCore::Action::"load_portfolio"::response{ }
};

// ---- policies 2 and 3: the trade gate, now BOTH required -----------------------------------
// Data freshness grants the trade.
permit (
    principal,
    action == AgentCore::Action::"execute_trade",
    resource
)
when temporal {
    formerly within 30s AgentCore::Action::"get_market_price"::response{ }
};

// Output-to-input integrity refuses it unless the profile it names was loaded in this trajectory.
forbid (
    principal,
    action == AgentCore::Action::"execute_trade",
    resource
)
unless temporal {
    formerly within 24h AgentCore::Action::"get_client_profile"::response{
        input.profile_id: context.input.profile_id
    }
};
